OL,3,GNEWSATeen plans hospital abseil after
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager is preparing to abseil down
OL,7,FSt Thomas' Hospital following a
OL,8,Fsuccessful surgery to correct a rare
OL,9,Fknee condition.
OL,11,FLacey Ward, 18, was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fmiserable malalignment syndrome (MMS)
OL,13,Fat 14, a condition where the thigh bone
OL,14,Frotates inwards but the shin bone
OL,15,Frotates outwards, causing chronic knee
OL,16,Fpain and instability.
OL,18,FAfter three procedures between 2024 and
OL,19,F2026 at Evelina London Children's
OL,20,FHospital, Ward is abseiling 160 ft
OL,21,F(48.77m) on Saturday to fundraise for
OL,22,Fthe children's hospital charity.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
