OL,3,GNEWSATeen plans hospital abseil after
OL,4,Asuccessful surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The care from Evelina is amazing. They
OL,7,Fgot me through my diagnosis when I
OL,8,Fthought nobody was able to help me,"
OL,9,FWard, from Dover, said.
